			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740870201,
					"content": "Is this where researchers spent their downtime? Is this even humane? Has the Fontaine Research Institute ever considered making renovating this place a priority?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chronie"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870202,
					"content": "...There should be a Survey Anchor here. Just like Ms. Chronie implied, this place needs renovation, and the power supply here is very limited... Or perhaps I should say, there's a complete shortage.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870203,
					"content": "#While I'm answering Ms. Chronie's questions, I'll leave the job of recovering the Survey Anchor to you, {NICKNAME}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7408703,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7408702",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7408702,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Nacker",
					"Chronie"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740870301,
					"content": "Compared to some other areas, the dormitories weren't impacted as much by the explosion.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870302,
					"content": "Dormitories? But I don't see even one bed here, so how do the researchers get any rest? It's not like they can sleep in chairs, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chronie"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870303,
					"content": "Ms. Chronie, your idea of \"resting\" is very different from that of the researchers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870304,
					"content": "When a researcher at the Fontaine Research Institute says they need rest, they only want a quick break for their brain.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870305,
					"content": "Then, they would usually come here, play piano, read, and have a drink or two if necessary.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870306,
					"content": "Uh, but wouldn't sleeping provide more rest for the brain?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chronie"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870307,
					"content": "You may be correct, but... To our researchers, sleeping is a waste of time in the first place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870308,
					"content": "Sleeping is a waste of time? No, it is essential for rest!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chronie"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870309,
					"content": "Sleeping completely cuts your train of thought short, and that's just not acceptable for our research work.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870310,
						740870311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870310,
					"content": "(Keep listening...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740870312,
					"content": "Are you being serious? If you don't sleep, the only thing that'll be cut short is your life!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chronie"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870313,
					"content": "Not necessarily. The institute boasts an excellent health care system that guarantees researchers' health and well-being.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870314,
					"content": "But that's still no reason to not sleep!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chronie"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870315,
					"content": "Also, if researchers are here to give their brains a break, wouldn't that break their thought process from research, anyway?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chronie"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870316,
					"content": "Not necessarily. It only seems like they're taking a break when actually, they're still pondering different academic subjects subconsciously.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870317,
					"content": "It's akin to a vast ocean that, while appearing calm on the surface, still has a strong undercurrent beneath.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870318,
					"content": "Sometimes, the undercurrents below are much stronger than the towering waves above.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870319,
					"content": "I get it. You mean when researchers of the Fontaine Research Institute are on a project, they must keep working and are not allowed to rest, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chronie"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870320,
					"content": "That is not completely fair to say. If they truly need sleep, they're free to go back home and do just that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870321,
					"content": "So, it is fairer to say that as long as researchers of the Fontaine Research Institute are inside the Institute, they must keep working and are not allowed to rest.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740870322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chronie"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870322,
					"content": "Your rhetoric is simply astound, Ms. Chronie.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Nacker"
				},
				{
					"id": 740870311,
					"content": "(Quit listening...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		}
	]
}